  },
  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "k0001",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We’re celebrating our birthday/anniversary this month and we’ve finally hit those teenage years with the big 1-3!",
          "_key": "k0002"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0003",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We’ve come a long way since our founding, here are a few facts you probably didn’t know about us:",
          "_key": "k0004"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0005",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Now that you’ve done the math, O3 was founded in 2005.",
          "_key": "k0006"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0007",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Wondering what our name stands for? Well, O3 represents the three sections of the business: marketing, design, and technology.",
          "_key": "k0008"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0009",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We originally began as a brand communications company with a technology slant.",
          "_key": "k0010"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0011",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We switched up our office location and in 2012, we moved from the Piazza at Northern Liberties to our current home on Frankford Ave.",
          "_key": "k0012"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0013",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0000"
          ],
          "text": "The team",
          "_key": "k0014"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " has grown from under 10 employees in 2005 to just over 30 of us today.",
          "_key": "k0015"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0000",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.o3world.com/about/team/"
        }
      ],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0016",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "To celebrate, we wanted to see what some of our staff members looked like at 13. Think you can spot a member of your project team or one of our c-suite executives?",
          "_key": "k0017"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0018",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Have a favorite O3 memory through the years? We’d love to hear it! Share with us below.",
          "_key": "k0019"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    }
  ],
